# Autonomous Systems Integrity Model (ASIM)

## Purpose
ASIM provides the technical protocol for drift detection and operational alignment. It ensures that an autonomous system’s objectives remain anchored to its core mission script despite recursive learning.

## Operational Standards
* **Mission Script Persistence:** Baseline instructions are stored in read-only memory blocks.
* **Drift Thresholds:** Any divergence from mission parameters $> 2\%$ triggers an immediate integrity check.
* **Alignment Verification:** Real-time cross-referencing of decision pathways against intended outcomes.
